@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Complete Interception Mission

actor Operator
participant RADAR as RADAR
participant "Control Station CS" as CS
participant "A-UAV (PX4)" as AUAV
participant "Z-UAV" as ZUAV

== Long range detection ==

RADAR -> CS: Send tracks (Z-UAV + A-UAV)
AUAV -> CS: Send MAVLink position
CS -> CS: Fuse tracks (RADAR + MAVLink)

== Mission decision ==

CS -> CS: Compute interception probability
CS -> Operator: Display probability
Operator -> CS: Approve mission start
CS -> AUAV: Start command + initial intercept area

== Mission execution ==

AUAV -> AUAV: Follow mission path
CS -> AUAV: Update intercept area (optional)
AUAV -> CS: Send telemetry (MAVLink)

== Intercept area reached ==

AUAV -> CS: Report arrival at intercept area
AUAV -> AUAV: Hover and hold position
CS -> AUAV: Confirm hover state

== Z&I preparation ==

CS -> AUAV: Z-UAV approach detected
AUAV -> AUAV: Align camera towards Z-UAVs

== Target consensus ==

AUAV -> AUAV: Exchange status (target availability)
AUAV -> AUAV: Consensus on target assignment

== End phase Z&I ==

ZUAV -> AUAV: Visual detection (400m)
ZUAV -> AUAV: Identification (200m)
AUAV -> AUAV: Course correction (camera-based)

== Interception ==

AUAV -> ZUAV: Start intercept flight
AUAV -> CS: Report interception progress
AUAV -> CS: Interception complete

== Mission end ==

CS -> AUAV: Land command
AUAV -> CS: Landing confirmed
CS -> Operator: Mission completed

@enduml
